window.QA_INDEX=[{"t":"Allahake 99 name","u":"/question-answer/","h":"nq-question-1","x":"Q)Assalamualaikum! Hazart ji last time mera sawal yeh tha ki Allahake 99 name masjid main kibla rukh diwar par lagana sahi hai (Marble/ girnate / glass / oilpaint / radium ) diwar par lagna sahi hai hawale se jawab ki guzarish Agar hindustan main kisi masjid main hai plz foto (whatsapp) par bhajeAssalamualaikum! Hazart ji last time mera sawal yeh tha ki Allahake 99 name masjid main kibla rukh diwar par lagana sahi hai (Marble/ girnate / glass / oilpaint / radium ) diwar par lagna sahi hai hawale se jawab ki guzarish Agar hindustan main kisi masjid main hai plz foto (whatsapp) par bhaje A)Takal"},{"t":"DAROOD PAAK","u":"/question-answer/","h":"nq-question-2","x":"Q)Bismillahir Rahmanir Raheem. Asalamualaikum wa Rahmatullah wa Barkatuhu! Jnab e Walla Boht boht shukrya ap k jawab ka. mager ek zimini sawal hay k main nay boht pehlay kisis kitaab jis ka mjhy naam bhool gya hay main perha k jb AP SAL ALLAH HO ALAIH WA ALL HI WSLAM nay ye c bataya to Janb OMER R.A nay afsoourdgi ka izhaar kia aor Pooochnay per Arz ki Ya Rasool Allah AP aor APKI ALL k lay to ye aa gaya hamary lay kia? iss per AP KAREEM AAQA nay kuch Irshad fermya jo main bhool gya hn kafi arsa guzer janay k i waja say. Main ager Apny Sawal ko mukhtisir Arz keroun to wo ye hay k jb Ap Sal Alla"},{"t":"Musafir ki Namaz","u":"/question-answer/","h":"nq-question-3","x":"Q)Assalamoalykum Kya farmate hai ulema ikram is masale me… Ki zaid ka madarsa uske ghar se 80km hai, Aur shahar ki abadi ke baad agar dekha jaye to 70km hai..aur chuki madarsa bhi shahar ke bilkul andar hai?? Is surat m jab zaid 14 din ki niyat se madrasa jayega to kya wo musafir hogaya namaz qasr karega ya wo muqeem hoga aur namaz m itmam karega.Note:Ghar se madarse tak ki doori 78km se zayada hai agar dono musafat ko abadi se bahar dekhenge to y doori 70km se bhi kam hojayegii? A)Jahan se sheher khatam hota ho wahan se 48 mile ki masafat shumaar hogi, yahi aksar Ulama ki ra’ye hai. (Fiqh Aca"},{"t":"Janwar ki Nasbandi","u":"/question-answer/","h":"nq-question-4","x":"Q)Mera pass pala hua billa raat bhar chillata hai doctor kehte hai uski nasbandi karege to woh nahi chilayega kya nasbandi jaanwar ki kara sakte hai haram ya gunah Hai kya? A)Is billa ko azad kar den aur dusra hasil kar len aur is ke siwa koi dusra rasta na ho kara lene me koi haraj nahi. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"Lawaris Laash ki pehchan","u":"/question-answer/","h":"nq-question-5","x":"Q)As sallam waalaikum agar kisi larki aurat ki lawaris laash mile toh kis tarah pata chalega woh kaun hai muslim hai ya gair muslim? A)Agar libas wagairah se musalaman ya gair-musalaman hone ka andaza ho jaye to uske mutabiq amal kiya jaye. Agar musalman ki alamat ho to ghusl de kar namaze janazah padhayi jaye. Agar kafir ki alamat ho to bagair namaz ke dafan kar diya jaye. Agar ksiis tarah se bhi pata nahi chal raha ho to, aisi surah me us ilaqe se andaza kiya jayega jahan laash mili hai, agar woh ilaqa musalmaano ka ho to musalmaan mana jayega, aur agar gair-musalmaan ilaqa ho to gair-muslim"},{"t":"Isha ki Char rakat Farz hai","u":"/question-answer/","h":"nq-question-6","x":"Q)as-salamlaikum! yak gair mukalid sai hama bahas huwa tha wo kah raha tha kee issa kee namaz sirf 7 rekat hai app hamai hadees kee rosni mai batayai mai makkah mai rahta hoon aur 5 namaz haram mai adaa karnai ka kosis karta hoon yahha per sab gair muqallid hai? A)Isha me sirf chaar rak’at farz hain. Isha ki farz namaz se pehle chaar rak’at sunate gair-mu’akada, farz ke baad do rak’at sunnate mu’akada, aur do nafil, phir witr ki teen rak’aten aur uske baad do rak’aten nafil. Ab koi agar sirf farz, wajib aur sunnate mu’akada jode to 9 rak’aten batayega. Sunnate Mu’akada hatade to woh 7 batayega"},{"t":"Dawa ka istemal mahwari rokne ke liye","u":"/question-answer/","h":"nq-question-7","x":"Q)As salamualaikum....main or meri wife umrah kerne jaa rahe hain.magar meri wife bohat pareshan hain k oss abhi tak haiz nahi howa hain .....ab hamare paas sirf 10 din hi hain jaane k liye.....plz hamaye bataye k kiya kerna chahiye jiss se wife ko haiz shuroo ho jaye.yaa umrah k halat me agar ho jaye to hame kiya kerna chaiye..kiya oss ka umrah kabool hoga? A)Dawa ka istemaal karen jisse mahwari ko rokne ke liye aati hai, aur Umrah ki tayyari karen."},{"t":"Topi ki Sunnat","u":"/question-answer/","h":"nq-question-8","x":"Q)Agar Koi Shakhs topi ko sunnat hi nahi manta aur sar khol kar namaz parhta hai to kya uske peechay namaaz ho jayegi. Kuch log topi ko \"culture\" maantay hai, unka kehna hai ki sar dakh kar namaaz parhnay ka hukm kaheen nahi aaya. Aisay shakhs ke peechay kya namaz ho jayegi? A)Aise shakhs ke peeche namaz ho jati hai, albatta behtar nahi. Sar dhak kar namaz ada karna chahiye. Hadithon me iska suboot milta hai ke Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) amama ke niche topi lagate the, sar khula nahi rakhte the."},{"t":"Talaq aur Bacho ki parwarish","u":"/question-answer/","h":"nq-question-9","x":"Q)Assalamoalykum! Hamare shahar m ek khatoon hai jinka nikah 13 saal pahle ek shaks se hua jisse 1 ladka jiski umar 10 saal hai aur ladki jiski umar12 saal hai paida hue. Khatoon ko kuch aasebi asar hone ki wajah se unke shauhar n khatoon ke bhai ko bulaya aur unke sath unko unke mayke bhej diya. Kai din baad ek saada lifafa registry se bheja uske baad mahar ki raqam bheji. Aur teesri baar ek registry bheji jisko padhe bina khatoon ne wapas kar diyaa. Us shaks ka kahna hai ke maine apni biwi ko talaaq de diya hai aur na bachcho de us khatoon ki baat karata hai aur na hi us khatoon se baat kart"},{"t":"Taawiz","u":"/question-answer/","h":"nq-question-10","x":"Q)Kya hadis sharif me tabis karna haram hai? A)Taweezon me agar Ayaten likhi jayen to Quran Majeed yaqeenan shifa hai, is me koi haraj nahi. Albatta ehteraam is ka rehna chahiye, aur agar koi khilaafe shariyat cheez ho to na-jaez hai."},{"t":"Miscellaneous Questions","u":"/question-answer-4/","h":"nq-question-1","x":"Q)Salam 1.farz namaz mei shuru ki 2 raqat bhari or baki khali q rhti hn? 2.isha namaz mei vitier namaz mei gr dua-e-qunoot gar yaad na ho to kya uski jagah kuch or padha ja sakta hy? suna hy ki uski jagah 3baar surah ikhlas padhi ja sakti hy? 3. kya Huzur Pak(S.a.w) k chahcha Hzrat abu talib imaan laye they? 4.hadees mei kuch aayat ya koi bhi amal namaz baad k liye subah shaam ka hota hy for ex 10 martaba durood-shareef payare nabi ki shafa't hasil krne k liye subah shaam padhe ya surah hshr ki 3 aytein pahei subah-sham.. to mera sawal hy ki yahanpe sham ki murad kab se hy?? kya asr baad ya ph"},{"t":"Saalgirah","u":"/question-answer-4/","h":"nq-question-2","x":"Q)As Salam O Alaikum Wr Wb Mera Sawal Hai Ki kya Islam Mei Salgirah Manaana Mana Hai?? Salgirah Ki Mubarak-Baad Dena Mana Hai?? YA Salgirah Ki Dawat Apne Ghar Walaon'n K Saath Manaana (Get Together) Mana Hai?? A)Saalgirah Gairon ka tareeqa hai, isko manana, iski mubarakbaad dena aur iski dawat karna, khana aur khilana sab mana hai. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"Shalwar ka takhne se nicha hona","u":"/question-answer-4/","h":"nq-question-3","x":"Q)Assalam alaikum, mera sawal ye hai ke payjama ka takhne se nicha pehanna kaisa hai? kya ye haram hai ya makrooh tehreemi hai? please daleel ke sath jald se jald explain kre... A)Ghamad me paijama ko takhnon ke neeche karna makrooh-tehreemi hai, Bukhari Shareef me hai ke jo shakhs apne Izaar (Pijama, wagairah) ko ghamad ki wajah se takhnon ke neeche latkayega to Allah uski taraf nazar karam bhi na farmayega.(Bukhari: Hadith No. 5783) Aur agar aisi niyat nahi hai to makrooh tanzeehi hai, beherhaal, ehtiyaat behtar hai. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"Baachcho me gape ke mutalliq","u":"/question-answer-4/","h":"nq-question-4","x":"Q)Assalamu alaikum wa rahmatullahi wa barkatuhu mera sawal ye hai ki kya hum log ya musalman log apne 2 bachcho ke bich umar ka farq apni sahuliyat se rakh sakte hai ya sehat ke hisab se A)Sirf 2 soorton me bachchon ke darmiyaan farq karne ki ijazat hai: (1) aurat ki sehat par bura asar parne ka darr ho jis ke bare me koi motabar Doctor mashwara de. (2) Bachchon ko munasib miqdar me Maan ka doodh na milne ka Darr ho. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"Want to know","u":"/question-answer-4/","h":"nq-question-5","x":"Q)Asslam walaikum wa rahmatullahi wa barkatuhu..... Mera sawal hai k AAP SALLALLAHU AALAIHI WASALLAM..NAMAJ me kya padte the jb k QURAN E PAAK NAJIL hona shuru tha..... A)Quran nazil hone se pehle namaz is haet (Halat) me nahi thi jisme Quran nazil hone ke baad hui hai. Salaat thi, Salaat ka matlab dua hota hai, aur pehle log qayaam aur sajda karte the, jisme woh sirf dua aur isteghfaar karte the."},{"t":"Movie me kisi nabi ya sahaba ko dikhna","u":"/question-answer-4/","h":"nq-question-6","x":"Q)Assalam alaikum, mera sawal ye hai ke aajkal kuch islamic history per movie ban rhi hai jisme sahaba ko dikhaya gya hai, kya aisi movie dekhna jaez hai? aur kya agar kisi movie me kisi nabi (yusuf a.s, moosa a.s, etc) ko dikhya jae to uska dikhna jaez hoga? plz give me answer with daleel because some knowlegable person says that it is jaez. A)Movie me SAHABAH aur AMBIYA ki jo tasweer pesh ki jati hai woh unke murtabe aur taqaddus se bahut ghatiya hai, actor bhi kafir, fasiq aur fajir hote hain. Is tarah ki Movie se unka status neecha hota hai, aur hum usko dekh kar gunehgaar hote hain, aur y"},{"t":"L.ic rcm","u":"/question-answer-4/","h":"nq-question-7","x":"Q)L.I.C aur R.C.M me job krna kaisa he jabke usme soodi kaam hota he.. A)LIC, RCM jaisi company me kaam karna jaez nahi hai. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"Sharyi masla","u":"/question-answer-4/","h":"nq-question-8","x":"Q)Assalamu alykum warehmatullahi wabarkatu..... mera sawal yahai ke agar kisi ladki ki lash nadi me mili ho aur uske paas koyi aysi chez nahi hai jis ke zarye ye pata chle ke ye hindu hai ya musalman our aas paas ke loog bhi usko nahi jante our kisi bhi tariqe se ye pata nahi chala ke wo hindu hai ya musalman ..to isko ab dafnaya jaye ga ya jalaya jayega ..meherbani farma kar is masle ka sharye hukum batayen.,, [khuda hafiz] A)Asalamualaikum wa Rahmatullah wa Barkatuhu Answer: Agar libaas wagairah se musalmaan ya gair-musalmaan hone ka andaza ho jaye, tab to is ke mutabiq amal kiya jaye, matla"},{"t":"Director","u":"/question-answer-4/","h":"nq-question-9","x":"Q)WHO IS THE DIRECTOR OF THIS CENTER AT A TIME? A)Asalamualaikum wa Rahmatullah wa Barkatuhu Maulana Bilal Abdul Hai Hasani Nadwi is the current director of the center and Dare Arafat. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"NAMAZ","u":"/question-answer-4/","h":"nq-question-10","x":"Q)AS SALAMU ALAIKUM.Isha ki namaz k bad jagna makruh h.pr hm ldkiyo or aurato ko to ghr k kam krne pdhte h to hm awwal waqt pr namaz ada kre ya sare kam khtm kr k sone se phle namaz pdh kr soye.or ek sawal, hame agar koi JAZAKALLAH Kahe to hm uska jawab kese de? A)Asalamualaikum wa Rahmatullah wa Barkatuhu Answer: Isha ke baad jald sona sunnat hai. Is silsile me Tirmizi Shareef me Hadith aayee hai magar Ulama ne likha hai ke Ilmi Majalis aur zaroori kaam kaj ke liye rukhsat hai. Makrooh jab hai jab ke aadmi kahaniyon, fuzool baton me apna waqt barbaad kare. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"GHAIR MUQALLID","u":"/question-answer-4/","h":"nq-question-11","x":"Q)GHAIR MUQALLID & HAQEEQAT E ALBANI PAR KUCH URDU BOOKS KE NAAM BATAIYE A)Asalamualaikum wa Rahmatullah wa Barkatuhu Answer: Ghair Muqallid par yeh kitaab bahut mufeed hai. Hamari Website me \"Sayyid Ahmad Shaheed Academy\" me yeh kitab mutala farmayen: \"Maslaki Ikhtelafaat aur Raah-e-Etedaal\" Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"Hijab","u":"/question-answer-4/","h":"nq-question-12","x":"Q)Salam mera ek sawal aur hai ki 1.Islam mei aoratoan(ladies) ko baloan(hair)k liye khaas hijab karna kyoon lazim hai?? iske peechey kya logic hai ki baaloan(hair) ko dhaankna kyun zaroori hai? A)Asalamualaikum wa Rahmatullah wa Barkatuhu Jis tarah aurton ke jism ke dusre parts satar me shamil hain, isi tarah unke balon ke bhi parda zaroori hai, baal aurat ki khoobsurti aur us ke Husn me dakhil hai, aur jis tarah uske jism ke dusre parts attractive hote hain aur unke taraf attraction hota hai isi tarah unke balon ka masla bhi hai. is liye unka hijaab zaroori hai. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi "},{"t":"Isha kay nemaz ka time","u":"/question-answer-3/","h":"nq-question-1","x":"Q)Isha ki nemaz ka time maghreb kay nemaz kay ketnay time baad shoro hota hay. A)Maghrib aur Isha ke darmiyaan ka waqt mukhtalif mulkon me mukhtalif hota hai, kahin kam kahin ziyada, lekin bunyadi baat yeh hai ke suraj guroob hone ke baad jab tak shafaq yani roshni baqi hai maghrib ka waqt hai aur jab roshni bilkul khatam ho jaye to isha ka waqt shuru ho jata hai. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"LIC & OTHER POLICIES","u":"/question-answer-3/","h":"nq-question-2","x":"Q)WHAT SHARIAT SAYS REGARDING TO OBTAIN LIC & OTHER POLICIES ,WHICH IS COMPULSORY FOR GOVERNMENT EMPLOYEES; IS IT PERMITTED BY ISLAM? A)If a person is in a situation that without undergoing LIC he is not safe or he has been pressurised by the government, then he is permitted to do so."},{"t":"PROPERTY RIGHT","u":"/question-answer-3/","h":"nq-question-3","x":"Q)If Brother has not given the sharing of Property to Sisters according to Shariat,then What Holy Quran & Hadith said regarding this ?plz guide in this Matter. A)Share of property of the sisters is clearly stated in the Holy Quran, if someone does against he is a trangressor and feeds on haraam"},{"t":"Namaz me hatho ka bandhna","u":"/question-answer-3/","h":"nq-question-4","x":"Q)Assalam alaikum, mera sawal ye hai ke kya sahih ahadees se namaz me naaf ke niche hatho ka bandna (jo ki hamare ahnaf ke yahan hai ) sabit hai, agar hai to plz refernce ke sath aur hadees ki sehat ke sath de taaki salfiyo ko btaya ja ske? A)Naaf ke neeche hath bandhna: Hadith (1)Hazrat Alqama bin Wael bin Hajar apne walid se riwayat karte hain, farmaya: main ne Nabi Kareem (S.A.W.) ko dekha ke Aap ne Daen hath (Right Hand) ko baen hath (Left Hand) par naaf ke neeche rakha. (Ibne Abi Sheba: Kitabus Salaat: 3959) (2) Hazrat Ali (R) ne farmaya: Sunnat yeh hai ki hatheli ko hatheli par rakha jay"},{"t":"Tasweer kashi aur anguthi","u":"/question-answer-3/","h":"nq-question-5","x":"Q)Assalamualaykum v.v. anguthi kis hath me aur hath ki kis ungali me pehanni chahiye? aur kese pahenni chahiye? ungali pahanne ke waqt ungali nang andar ki tarah rahe ya bahir ki tarah?| marad ke liye shariat ki roshni me sharai haqiqat batae. purani tasweer ho to uski sharai haqiqat kya he? purani tasweer ko kese nabud kare?| jala ke ya dafan karke ya kisi aur tariqe se? A)(1) Allah ke Rasool (S.A.W.) se dayen (right) bayen (left) dono hath me angoothi pehenna sabit hai, magar dayen hath men pehenne ki riwayaat kasrat se maujood hain. (Shamael Tirmizi) Angoothi sirf choti ungli me pehenna sab"},{"t":"Nind sone ka sahi waqt","u":"/question-answer-3/","h":"nq-question-6","x":"Q)Kiya magrib ki namaz ke bad nind sona mana hai isse barkat kam hoti hai. A)Allah ke Rasool (S.A.W.) Isha se pehle (Maghrib ke baad) sone ko na-pasand karte the (Bukhari:568, Tirmizi:168). Is liye Maghrib ke baad nahi sona chahiye. Aur jahan tak barkat kam hone ki baat hai to is ka suboot kahin nahi mil saka. Maghrib baad sone se is liye mana kiya gaya hai ke sone se Isha ki namaz ke chhotne ka khatra rehta hai. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center \\"},{"t":"Qunoot","u":"/question-answer-3/","h":"nq-question-7","x":"Q)What is the ruling on qunoot? A)It is compulsory to recite a dua in the third rakaat of Vitr prayer of Isha, however, Dua-e-Qunoot is proven to be recited by the Prophet of Allah (S.A.W.). Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"KBC KA PAISA JAYEZ YA NA JAYEZ?","u":"/question-answer-3/","h":"nq-question-8","x":"Q)KBC (KAON BANEGA KAROR PATI) GAME SHOW SE HASIL SHUDAH RAQUAM KA LENA OR ISTEMAL KARNA JAEZ HAI YA NAHIN? FOR MOR INFORMATION ABOUT \\'\\'KBC\\'\\' CLICK THIS LINK. http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaun_Banega_Crorepati A)You can name the house \"Al-Mamoor\", \"Al-Mustaqar\". Enter the house with you right foot first and recite this dua: \"Allahumma Inni As'aluka Khair al-muliji wa khair al-makhriji Bismillahi walajna w bismillahi kharajna wa ala allahi rab bana tawak-kalna\" (AbuDawood:5098) Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center Is tarah ke programon ke andar jis men ke har sawaal par raqam muqarrar (fix)"},{"t":"Salat","u":"/question-answer-3/","h":"nq-question-9","x":"Q)Assalamualaikum recently i am doing a d2d sells job for that i have to go in different suburb phisically.the problem is that during that period asar and magrib prayer time is appeared but in that time i am in field like there is no masjid .so what i have to do i can pray my prayer when i will come back?is there any option? A)Offering the prayers in its timing is better and recommended by the Shariah, as stated in the Holy Qur`an in Surah Nisa verse: 103. In this situation, mosque is not compulsory. If mosque is not present, and you get a place to offer it on the way, it should be done that w"},{"t":"Namaz","u":"/question-answer-3/","h":"nq-question-10","x":"Q)Assalamualaykum maulana zarwali khan db ke bayan me suna k barelviyo k piche padhi hui sab namaze dohrane padegi me jab jama'at me gaya tha to gasht k liye waha k maqami sathiyo ne magrib barelvi k piche padhwai thi to wo namaz muje dohrani padegi? faqt wassalam A)Bid`ati (Barelvi) ke peeche namaz padhna makrooh hai, jab ke bid`ati kufriya `amaal wa af`aal ka murtakib na ho, aur kufriya aqaed na rakhta ho, aur faraez ka munkir na ho; Aur agar in me se koi bhi usme payee jati ho to uske peeche namaz nahi hogi, aur uske peeche padhi gayee namaz bhi duhrani hogi. (Radul Mukhtaar: 2/298)"},{"t":"Marriage","u":"/question-answer-3/","h":"nq-question-11","x":"Q)Is the process of Nikah is possible without 2 witness and if the girl decides his meher amount and boy read his nikha as per sunnat with both wish of boy and girl they are agree. A)(1)Nikah cannot be conducted without two witnesses. Because it is stated in the Holy Quran, Surah Baqarah, Verse No. 282 \"and get two witnesses, out of your own men, and if there are not two men, then a man and two women\". (2)Girl can fix her meher because its her rights. (3)Boy can conduct his nikah, it is permissible under shariah, but if a girl marries a boy which may not be from her kith and kin may result in "},{"t":"Books written by Moulana abul hasan ali nadvi.","u":"/question-answer-3/","h":"nq-question-12","x":"Q)Assalamualaikum. Please send the details where i can get all the books written by Moulana Abul Hasan Ali Nadvi sahab in Urdu & English through post. Jazakallah A)All books written by Hazrat Maulana Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi (Rh) is available here. Which ever you want, will be sent to you as you tell us your complete postal address and the names of the books, with 50% discount. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"Rozi","u":"/question-answer-2/","h":"nq-question-1","x":"Q)Meri roozi ghati hai is ka islam wajah aur kaise barhaya jaye koi dua koi tareeka? A)Rozi kyun ghat rahi hai, iske asbaab par aap khud gaur karen kyunki kisi musalmaan ki niyat par hamla nahi kiya ja sakta, albatta rozi ka ghatna kabhi Allah ki yaad se ghaflat aur Ahkaam-e-Ilahi se laparwahi ki bunyaad par hota hai. (Surah Taha:124) Aur kabhi aazmaesh hoti hai, Allah ki taraf se aur sabr karne walon ko bhar bhar kar diya jata hai. (Surah baqarah:155) Quran Kareem me maal ki ziyadati ka zariya Isteghfaar ki kasrat ko bataya gaya hai, Aap Isteghfaar ki kasrat karen, Allah aap ki rozi badha deg"},{"t":"Bank Job","u":"/question-answer-2/","h":"nq-question-2","x":"Q)Assalamualikum kya bank me job karna jayaz he agar nahi to kis liye? A)Bank ki aisi naukri jis me soodi mamlaat likhne padte hon ya unse wasta padta ho durust nahi hai, is liye ke Allah ke Rasool (Sallalahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne aise admi ko sirf mal'oon hi qarar nahi diya balke use soodkhoron se mushabeh qarar diya hai. (Muslim, Kitabul Buyu) Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"Zakat","u":"/question-answer-2/","h":"nq-question-3","x":"Q)Mera bhanja university me admit hey aur aagey padhna chahta hey, mere behnoi ki koi job nahi hey aur bhanje ka bhi kamai ka koi zarya nahi hey (woh student hey) tu kia mey zakat ki raqam me se us ke taleem ke ikhrajat ada kar sakta hun. A)Agar aapne Zakaat ki raqam se taleem ke ikhrajaat khud ada kiye to aap ki zakaat ada na hogi, is liye zakaat ke liye Tamleek (Malik banana) shart hai, is ka tareeqa yeh hai ke agar bhanja Sahib-e-Nisaab nahi hai to aap zakaat ki raqam ka apne bhanje ko malik banayen phir woh khud is maal se apne ikhrajaat ada kare. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"Qunot-e-nazala","u":"/question-answer-2/","h":"nq-question-4","x":"Q)Salam, i want to know about recitation of qunot-e-nazala,how long hazrat muhammad s.a.a.w recites it, and how long we can recites,what is sunnat time to recite. jazakallah A)The prophet of Allah (Sallahu Alaihi Wasallam) did not used to recite Qunoot-e-Nazla for long. You are also requested to recite it short, caring for the Muqtadi that they must not feel uncomfortable. The Prophet of Allah (Sallahu Alaihi Wasallam) used to recite in Fajr Salat whenever any trouble or mischief came upon Muslim community, and he used to keep it short. (Muslim: 1546) Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"Perfume","u":"/question-answer-2/","h":"nq-question-5","x":"Q)Kya farmate hain Ulma e karam perfume ke istemal ke baare me? A)Perfume me jo Alcohol hota hai woh mahreen ke research and information ke mutabiq nasha-awar nahi hota hai, is liye na paak nahi hota hai. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"Ladies Driving","u":"/question-answer-2/","h":"nq-question-6","x":"Q)Aurton ke car ya scooty driving ka sharii kya nazarya hai? A)Aurat ko scooter wa car chalane ke bare me shariyat ka nuqta-nazar yeh hai ke mukammal parda ke sath woh yeh kaam kar sakti hai , jabke zaroorat ho, kyunki aurat ka nafqa matlab khane or kamane ki zimmedari uske shauhar ke zimme hai. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"Masjid mein Sona","u":"/question-answer-2/","h":"nq-question-7","x":"Q)Baaz log Tablig waalo pe aitraz krte hain ke ye log Masajid me sote hain, unnhe kya daleel di jae hadees aur sahaba ke aml se? A)Masjid me jamaat walon ke sone par eteraaz nahi hona chahiye kyunki shariat ne musafiron ke masjid me qayaam par koi rukawat nahi lagayi aur waise bhi agar koi masjid me Etikaaf ki niyat se soye to uski ijazat Hadith se maloom hoti hai. Bukhari me Hazrat Ibn Umar (Rdh) se marwi hai ki woh masjid-e-nabawi me sote the halanke woh jawaan the. (Bukhari:3738) Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"Name of House","u":"/question-answer-2/","h":"nq-question-8","x":"Q)By the grace of Allah,we build a house.We need a good name for it.Guidance fro entering in the new house according to shariat. JazakAllah A)You can name the house \"Al-Mamoor\", \"Al-Mustaqar\". Enter the house with you right foot first and recite this dua: \"Allahumma Inni As'aluka Khair al-muliji wa khair al-makhriji Bismillahi walajna w bismillahi kharajna wa ala allahi rab bana tawak-kalna\" (AbuDawood:5098) Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"Relationship","u":"/question-answer-2/","h":"nq-question-9","x":"Q)After having death (intekaal) of a family member (eg mother). Shall we refrain from having sexual relationship with wife. If yes, for how many days A)Talaq waqe ho gayi. Shauhar agar keh raha hai to uska etbaar kiya jayega.Shauhar ne talaaq di hai to ye bhi maloom karna zaroori hai ki kitni talaaq di hai. Agar 1-2 talaqen di hain to ruju (wapsi) kar sakta hai.3 talaaqon ke baad ruju nahi hai. Bache ab is umar me baap ke paas hi rahenge. Is khatoon ko kisi aur mard se iddat guzaarne ke baad nikah karne ka hukm hai. 3 talaaq agar nahi hui hai to samjha bujha kar wapsi ki surat nikalni chahiye."},{"t":"Surrogacy","u":"/question-answer-2/","h":"nq-question-10","x":"Q)Assalamualaikum wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuhu. Is surrogacy allowed in islam? And what if he denies the child after birth? Who takes its responsibility? A)Surrogacy is allowed only when the sexual excretions are of husband and wife, because the prophet of allah (sallalahu aliahi wasallam) has said: “it is not permissible for those who believe in allah and the day of judgement to irrigate with one’s water others harvest”. (abudawood:2158) that’s why donation of sperm or ovary is not allowed in islam. Wassalam abul hasan ali nadwi center"},{"t":"Doctor in mosque","u":"/question-answer-2/","h":"nq-question-11","x":"Q)My question is that can a mbbs doctor treat his patients in a masjid for free,and the timings would'nt clash with the namaz timings,there will be a seperate room for him,but it is the masjid premisis but has a different entrance.please reply. A)It is permissible to do the doctor’s procedure in masjid, but it is better to ask the permission of the management of the masjid, and at the time of seeing patients, it should be taken care of that due to the patients’ behavior, nothing in the masjid gets affected and soil or dirty the majid. wassalam abul hasan ali nadwi center"},{"t":"Namaz","u":"/question-answer-2/","h":"nq-question-12","x":"Q)Assalam alaikum.mera sawal hai k subha ki sunnat namaz k baad ad ki ja sakti hai? Aur aksar log iqamat hone k baad b sunnat parte hai kya yeh sahih hai? A)Ahnaaf ke nazdeek fajir namaz ke farz ke baad sunnat nahi padh sakte, magar suraj nikal jane aur makrooh waqt guzar jane ke baad fajir ki sunnat padh sakte hain (tirmizi:423), ahnaaf ke nazdeek fajir ki namaz khadi ho jane ke baad bhi sunnat padh sakte hain. (durul mukhtaar:510/2) mukhtalif sahabah se manqool hai ke unhon ne fajir ki iqamat hone ke baad bhi fajir ki sunnat ada farmayi. Lekin is baat ka khayaal rah eke jamaat khadi hone ke "},{"t":"laham (meat)","u":"/question-answer-2/","h":"nq-question-13","x":"Q)Assalamu alykum. Hazrat mujhe yeh pata karna hai ki har halaal jaanwar me woh 7 chezein kaun si hoti hain jinko khana mana hai A)Yeh sat cheezen hain: (1) behne wala khoon, (2) penis, (3) fota (testicles), (4) maq’ad (anus), (5)ghudood, (6)urinary bladder, (7) pitta (pancreas). (baihaqi kubra:20192) wassalam abul hasan ali nadwi center"},{"t":"Tasawuf","u":"/question-answer-5/","h":"nq-question-1","x":"Q)Who is Mawlana AbdusSubhaan Nakhuda Nadwi Bhatkali? He is teaching in nadwa or devbandh or raibareli? A)Asalamualaikum wa Rahmatullah wa Barkatuhu Maulana Abdus Subhaan Nadwi is a person of balanced thinking and deep knowledge. He is a great speaker and writer of high profile. He is among the responsible persons in Madrasa Ziaul Uloom affiliation of Nadwatul Ulama and a successful teacher. He has completed his studies from Jamia Islamia Bhatkal, then Nadwatul Ulama and spent four years of studies in Jamia Islamia Madinah Munawwarah. Thereafter, he is attached to Madrasa Ziaul Uloom and at pr"},{"t":"Gusul","u":"/question-answer-5/","h":"nq-question-2","x":"Q)Can we take a gusul without wearing cloths? A)Asalamualaikum wa Rahmatullah wa Barkatuhu Yes, we can take gusul without clothes but at those places where no one can see. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"Supplication.","u":"/question-answer-5/","h":"nq-question-3","x":"Q)My sister met with an accident on 31 december.please tell me some dua or wazaif.she is in very critical condition.please do remember her in your duas also. A)Ghamad me paijama ko takhnon ke neeche karna makrooh-tehreemi hai, Bukhari Shareef me hai ke jo shakhs apne Izaar (Pijama, wagairah) ko ghamad ki wajah se takhnon ke neeche latkayega to Allah uski taraf nazar karam bhi na farmayega.(Bukhari: Hadith No. 5783) Aur agar aisi niyat nahi hai to makrooh tanzeehi hai, beherhaal, ehtiyaat behtar hai. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi CenterAsalmaualaikum wa Rahmatullah Din men 100 martaba yah padhe"},{"t":"Islam","u":"/question-answer-5/","h":"nq-question-4","x":"Q)Assalamu Alaikum. Allah aap hazraat ko jazai e khair ataa farmaye. Mein ye janna chahta hun k kya hamara gair muqallideen k sath sirf fiqhi ikhtilaaf hai ya aqaid mein b hai? Agar hai to kya kya hai? Barai e karam jawab jaldi marhamat farmaye. Wassalaam A)Asalamualaikum wa Rahmatullah wa Barkatuhu Hamara Gair muqalideen se ikhtilaaf sirf fiqhi aur nazaryati hai, albatta woh is me itni shiddat aur gulu ikhtiyaar karte hain ke mamla bigarhta chala jata hai. unki shiddat pasandi ki wajah se muslim muasharah me inteshaar ke surat paida hoti hai, is liye unse ulajhne ke bajae hikmat se kaam lena "},{"t":"Basair","u":"/question-answer-5/","h":"nq-question-5","x":"Q)Where can i get the book \"basair\" online by maulana ali mian (rahmatullA ALIHI)? A)We are glad that you asked. We like to advise you to register yourself on our site so that when this book may get uploaded you will be sent the link to it. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"Dawato tableeg","u":"/question-answer-5/","h":"nq-question-6","x":"Q)Kya ham molana kaleem siddiqi (phulatwale)ki tehrik me shamil ho sakte he?molana konse maslak se taalluk rakhte he?kya un par akabir ka etemad hasil he?mery rahnumayi farmaye. me unke risale ko padhta hu is liye me puch raha hu. A)Kaleem Siddiqui Sb. ki tehreek me shamil hone se ihtiyaat karen. Maslak unka ehle-deoband ka hai. Lekin Apne kaam ko faroogh dene ke liye woh ghulu se kaam lete hain, aur baat saaf saaf jhoot tak pahunch jati hai, is liye ab akabireen unki taeed me ehtiyaat karte hain. Unke risaale main \"Naseem-e-hidayat ke jhonke\" ke naam se jo column hain woh qabil-e-etebaar nahi"},{"t":"Biography","u":"/question-answer-5/","h":"nq-question-7","x":"Q)What is the name of biography of allama syed abul hasan ali hasani nadvi ra A)There are many special issue magazines, books and palmphets on his life and works. He himself has penned his works and great part of his life in the book \"Karvan-e-Zindagi\" in seven parts. However, two of the books are also being given: (a) Hazrat Maulana Sayyid Abul Hasan Ali Hasani Nadwi-Ahed Saaz Shakhsiyat by Hazrat Maulana Sayyid Muhammad Rabey Hasani Nadwi (b) Sawaneh Muffakir-e-Islam by Maulana Bilal Abdul Hai Hasani Nadwi Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center Dar-e-Arafat, Takiya Kalan, Raebareli (U.P.)22900"},{"t":"Tasawwuf","u":"/question-answer-5/","h":"nq-question-8","x":"Q)Who was hazrat moulana syed shah muhammed ali mungheri ra A)Maulana M. Ali Mungeri (Rh) was the founder of Nadwatul Ulama and prominent Khalifa of Maulana Fazlur Rahman Ganj Muradabadi (Rh). For more detail please check: Seerat Mohammad Ali Mungeri (Rh) by Maulana Muhammadul Hasani"},{"t":"Tasawwuf","u":"/question-answer-5/","h":"nq-question-9","x":"Q)Who are the khalifa of hazrat moulana shah fazlur rahman ganj moradabadi ra A)Maulana Fazlur Rahman Ganj Muradabadi (Rh) had some famous Khalifas: Maulana M. Ali Mungeri, His son Ahmad Miyan Sb, Maulana M. Idrees Sb. Nigrami, Maulana Badr Ali Shah Raebarelvi, maulana Tajammul Husain Bihari, Muhadis Jaleel Maulana Zaheer Ahmad Sb., maulana Sayyid Zahoorul Islam Fatehpuri, Maulana Shah Abdul Kareem Sb. Punjabi, Maulana Noor Mohammad Sb. Punjabi, etc. For more details please check: Tazkira Hazrat Maulana Fazlur Rahman Ganj Muradabadi (Rh) by Hazrat Maulana Sayyid Abul Hasan Ali Hasani Nadwi (Rh"},{"t":"Fazaail e amal","u":"/question-answer-5/","h":"nq-question-10","x":"Q)Assalamualaikum please answer my following questions 1)my friends argue with me about fazaail e amal that it contains zaeef hadith,so how should i answer them about it? 2)what is the difference in aqeedah between us and jamaat e islami? 3)my friends argue that spending 40 days in jamaat is contrary to sunnah?is it true? A)(1) Zaeef hadith does not mean that it should be thrown into dustpit, perhaps, for Ahkamat, if there are Sahih Hadith then Zaeef Hadith are not used in practice, and Ulama have always been united on the fact that, for Fazael, Zaeef hadith can be used. However, Zaeef is a ph"},{"t":"Photos","u":"/question-answer-5/","h":"nq-question-11","x":"Q)As salamu alaikum.hme photo wagera khichwane k lye mna kiya jata h to kya jo islamic programes ki cd bnti h jalse ya competition ki use bnana or dkhna sahi h?or agr aazaan ho hm ek aazan ka jwb de or dusri ho jye to us wqt kya kre or phli wali khtm hone k bad us k bad ki dua pdhe ya dusri wali ka jawab de. A)(1) Film Tasweer ke Hukum me nahi hai, Isliye Islami CD dekhna aur banana jaez hai. (2) Agar ek sath kayee azaan ho rahi ho to qareebi masjid ki niyat se jawab den aur agar ek ke baad dusri azaan ho to pehli azaan ka jawab dena behtar hai, chahe woh qareeb ki masjid ki ho ya usse door ki"},{"t":"Female teachers","u":"/question-answer-5/","h":"nq-question-12","x":"Q)What do the Ulama say regarding Muslim girls leaving their homes and going to Schools where there is no proper Hijaab System? Male Teachers teach the female students and vice versa. A)Ulama have always believed in necessity of achieving knowledge, thereby, girls can go out of their houses and achieve it, but parda is compulsory and used be taken care of. Because in Quran, it says: \"O Prophet! Tell thy wives and daughters, and the believing women, that they should cast their outer garments over their persons (when abroad): that is most convenient, that they should be known (as such) and not m"},{"t":"Aadabe quran","u":"/question-answer-6/","h":"nq-question-1","x":"Q)Is it permissible to read quran in buses,trains,garden,park,etc where non-muslims are also present? A)It should be taken care that the respect of the Holy Qur`an is obligatory on every person. So, one should recite the Qur`an in low voice at such places because recitation in low voice does not contain any danger of impudence, and recitation in loud voice is Makrooh. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center Dar-e-Arafat, Takiya Kalan, Raebareli (U.P.)229001"},{"t":"Nazro ki hifazat","u":"/question-answer-6/","h":"nq-question-2","x":"Q)I am a college student . in my college there are female teachers who teach us .is it permissible to see them during teaching or conversation with them .? A)If it isn't feared that it might arouse bad thoughts in the mind, then it is permissible that you can see her with slight and careless sight. But, one must restrict from watching her and talking to her unnecessarily. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"Education","u":"/question-answer-6/","h":"nq-question-3","x":"Q)Assalamualekum wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuhu. I am studying chartered accountancy. My question is that in this line of profession tax evasion, false entry of income or expenses are done here in India. The reason behind this that Govt. is putting lots of tax on a single Assessee with a high rate of tax. So the Assessee desires to pay less tax. And thats why they evade tax and manipulate their accounts. It is also to be noted that an Assessee will only come to the C.A. if he helps him to save his tax payment. And i also like to tell that muslims are also affected by such problem of paying heav"},{"t":"Dress","u":"/question-answer-6/","h":"nq-question-4","x":"Q)Im wearing a half t-shirt during namaaz ,but problem is that my elbow is open in namaz,so my namaaz is valid or not? A)Open elbows during namaz is makrooh, however, acceptable with the sense of incompleteness."},{"t":"Aqaid","u":"/question-answer-6/","h":"nq-question-5","x":"Q)Dr.Zakir Nakir aqaid or najariyat bataye?kya vo gair muqallid he?unke lecture ko sunna kesa he?kyunke deoband ke ulama mana karte he.aapki kya ray he? A)Dr. Zakir Naik Sb. dawat ka bahut achcha kaam kar rahe hain aur Fiqh me Ehle-Hadith ko mante hain. Kabhi kabhi woh apne Dawat ke Topic se hat kar dusre topic par bayan dete hain, jo unka topic nahi hai, jo kafi galat fehmiyon ki wajah banta hai. Jab unka bayan suna jaye to in baton ko dheyaan me rakha jaye."},{"t":"About Maulana Waheeduddin khan","u":"/question-answer-6/","h":"nq-question-6","x":"Q)Assalam alaikum, please tell me, why ulma e karaam neglected maulana waheeduddin khan? tell me in detail as soon as possible A)Asalamualaikum wa Rahmatullah Waheedudden Khan had been a renowned scholar throughout the times and he was appreciated by many of the present and near past Ulamas but gradually he started diverting his ideology and thinking of Islam and presented before the people of Islam and others what the orientalists had been presenting about Islam. He changed the way of thinking which was brought by the Prophet of Islam."},{"t":"Tasawwuf","u":"/question-answer-6/","h":"nq-question-7","x":"Q)Molana alimiya nadwi rh kinke khulafa me se he?haji imdadullah muhajire makki rh kinke khulafa me se he?jald jawab de bahot confusion ho raha he A)Asalamualaikum wa Rahmatullah Answer: Hazrat Maulana Sayyid Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi (Rh) ko in silsilon me ijazat hasil hai: Qadiriya Naqshbandiya (Ahsaniya or Ahmadiya) Chishtiya (Sabiriya or Nizamiya) Suhrawardiya Aur in logon se Ijazat hasil hai: Hazrat Maulana Abdul Qadir Raipuri (Rh) Hazrat Maulana Ahmad Ali Lahori (Rh) Aur In Mashaekh-e-Kibaar ka Etemaad hasil Raha: Hazrat Shaikh Haroonul Asal Al-Hajjaar (Rh) Hazrat Maulana Mohammad ILyaas Kand"},{"t":"Praying the namaz","u":"/question-answer-6/","h":"nq-question-8","x":"Q)While praying the NAMAZ,it is compulsory to fold extra part of clothes of pants? A)Asalamualaikum wa Rahmatullah wa Barkatuhu Answer: Agar libaas wagairah se musalmaan ya gair-musalmaan hone ka andaza ho jaye, tab to is ke mutabiq amal kiya jaye, matlab agar musalman ki alamat ho to gusul de kar namaz bhi padhi jaye aur agar kafir ki alamat ho to is ko bagair namaz ke dafan kar diya jaye. Agar kisi tarah bhi pata na chal pa raha hai ke musalman ya gair musalman hai to aisi surat me dusre area se andaza kiya jaye ga. jahan laash dastiyaab hoyi hai, agar is ilaqa me musalman area ho to musalma"},{"t":"Sadqa k dena","u":"/question-answer-6/","h":"nq-question-9","x":"Q)Assalam alaikum, aaj kal jo faqir ghumte rahte hain unme akser sehatmand hote hain ya peshewer hote hain, kya unhe sadqa diya ja skta hai? A)Is tarah ke jo peshewar faqeer hatte katte hon un ko Sadqa diya ja sakta hai, lekin ziyada behtar yahi hai ke unko na diya jaye, is liye ke un ko dunya ek taraf zaroorat na hote huye bhi aur kamayee par qudrat hasil hone ke bawajood bhi mangne par un ki himmat afzaee karna hai. Aur bure kaam me himmat afzaee aur ta`awun se mana kiya gaya hai, lekin beher surat un ko dantne dapatne se parheez karna chahiye, is liye ke Qur'an me sael ko dantne se mana kiy"},{"t":"Reference of hadees quoted by maulana salman nadvi","u":"/question-answer-6/","h":"nq-question-10","x":"Q)Assalam alaikum Please tell me the reference of hadees quoted by Maulana Salman Husaini Nadvi sb. in his speech \"YAHOODI SAAZISHEN AUR HAMARI ZIMMEDARI\", because some salafi brothers wants. HADEES :- \"JO SHAKS JHALAT KA NAARA LGAE USSE MAA BAHAN KI GALI DO\". please give me answer as soon as possible. A)The Hadith qouted by Salman Husaini Nadwi, Reference: Sunan Nasai`e (Kubra) Hadith No. 10810 Bab Azaul Jahilia Kitab Amalul Yuma Wal Lail and Shaikh Albani has confermed that this Hadith is authentic. and Musnad Ahmad bin Hanbal has also qouted this hadith. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"Making up missed Salat (Qaza-e-Umri)","u":"/question-answer-6/","h":"nq-question-11","x":"Q)Dear Sir, Asslamualikum Eid Mubarak to all of you! As usual I have a question regarding making up of missed Salat(prayer). Actually my grandfather is a person who is very attached to regular prayers. Apart from daily prayers now he is making up for missed prayers that he missed in the past. But the problem is he don't know how many times he have missed Salat throughout his life time. Regarding this matter, I would be very grateful if you can provide a proper solution for it. With Regards, Twahir A)At first, you will have to make it out the approximate due period in which your father have mis"},{"t":"Few Questions","u":"/question-answer-6/","h":"nq-question-12","x":"Q)Salam i hv few ques'ns 1.kya qurbani ka GOSHT non-muslims ko diya jaa sakta hy? 2.Gar kisi ne QURAN ki kasam khai ho aur wo torr de tou kya hoga?? for ex:- jaise kasam ho ki gar koi condition pori na hui tou tab tak wo ghar nahi jayega? 3.gar koi ladki Haiz ki haalat mei hy aur baaloan mei mehndi laga lei tou kya aisa karna sahi hai?suna hy aise haal mei mehndi lagaye to wo 40 din tak pak nahi hoti?? A)(1)Qurbani ka gosht non-muslim ko dena JAEZ hai. (2) Agar koi shakhs Quran ya Allah ki qasam kha leta hai aur phir tod deta hai, to uske upar teen me se ek kaam ko karna wajib ata hai: (a) dus"},{"t":"Sadqa","u":"/question-answer-7/","h":"nq-question-1","x":"Q)Salam Sir Main ne suna hai dukhoon aur museebtoon se bachne ke lye sadqa karna chahye. Mera sawal yeh hai keh kia sadqka ki raqam masjid mein di ja sakti hai? please mujhe answer zaroor dijye ga . Insan jab koi bura khwab dekhta hai ya us ke dil mein bure khyalat atey hain to kia museebtoon dukhoon aur preshanion ke liye sadqa ki raqam masjid mein di ja sakti hai. Jo masjid ke bahir chanda wala box hota hai kia yeh rakam us mein dal dein? A)Ahadeeth me muta`adid jagah aya hai ki parehani aur musibat ke waqt sadqa ki madad len, kyunki sadqa har pareshaani aur musibat ko door kar deti hai. Aap"},{"t":"Dawat","u":"/question-answer-7/","h":"nq-question-2","x":"Q)Agar koe left hand se pani pi raha ho tu kya us ko pani pete waqt he tokna aur us k hand se pull karlena bottle sahe hae jab ki wa bottle se pi raha hae A)Bain haath se pani pina sunnat ke khilaaf hai, aur agar koi aisa kar raha hai to behtar tareeqa par usko toka jaye, hath se pani kheench lene se badmazgi paida ho sakti hai., aur kisi musalmaan ko takleef dena gunaah hai. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"Tasawwuf","u":"/question-answer-7/","h":"nq-question-3","x":"Q)Who was hazrat moulana Shah FazlurRahman Ganj Moradabadi (Rh) ? A)Hazrat Maulana Fazur Rahman sahab (Rh) Hadith me bade buland paya, Bade aali sanad, taweelul Umar aur apne zamane ke sahib-e-Muqamaat wa karamaat auliya Allah me se the. 1208 H me Mallawan me paida hue the. Shah Abdul Aziz Muhaddis Dahalvi (Rh) aur dusre us zamane ke Kibaar Ulama se taleem hasil ki. Hazrat Maulana Shah Muhammad Afaaq Sb. se bait ki aur unhi se Ijazat wa Khilafat se Musharraf hue. Please Check out the book by Hazrat Maulana Abul Hasan ALi Nadwi (Rh): Tazkira Hazrat Maulana Fazur Rahman Ganj Muradabadi Wassalam "},{"t":"Hajj E Badal","u":"/question-answer-7/","h":"nq-question-4","x":"Q)Salam o alaykum kya Hajj e badal sirf wahi insaan kar sakta hai jo apna hajj kar chuka hai?? ya koi aur bhi kar sakta hai??jaise beta ya beti jiska apna hajj nahi hua hai lekin uska irada apna haj karne ka hai. baraye meharbani iska jawab mujhe Quran aur hadees ki roshni mei dei ki Quran mei kahan kis surah mei iska ziqr hai aur kiss hadees mein iska khualsa hai. mera doosra sawal hai ki aulaad apne parents ya apne doosre rishtoan k liye aisal e sawab ki niyat se paisa,samaan ya khana waghaira nikalte ya dete hain to iske liye kya unke naam se sadqe ki niyat ka paisa us aisal e sawwb k kaam "},{"t":"Tasawwuf","u":"/question-answer-7/","h":"nq-question-5","x":"Q)Who are the khalifa of Ali Miyan Nadwi (Rh) ? A)Hazrat Maulana Ali Miyan (Rh) ke 40 se zyada Khalifa hain. Un me Hazrat maulana Sayyid Mohammad Rabey Hasani Nadwi ko Jan nasheeni ka sharf hasil hai. Un ke ilawa marhoomeen me Hazrat Maulana Abdul Rasheed Nomani(Rh) (Pakistan), Maulana Mufti AbdulAziz Sb. Raipuri(Rh), Maulana Abdul Kareem Parekh(Rh), Mumtaz hain. Maujooda Khulafa me Hazrat Maulana Sayyid Mohammad Rabey Hasani Nadwi ke ilawa Hazrat Maulana Sayyid Abdullah Hasani Nadwi (Lecturer of Hadith, Darul Uloom Nadwatul Ulama). Tableeghi Jamaat ke Zimmedaraan maulana Zubairul Hasan Sb., m"},{"t":"IHRAM","u":"/question-answer-7/","h":"nq-question-6","x":"Q)I am staying near jeddah after mekat, is it farz to wear IHRAM to go for TAWAF a KABA`A A)It is not necessary to wear Ihraam for Tawaf-e-Kabaa, But if, you want to enter Masjid-e-Haraam for Hajj or Umrah, then you will have to wear Ihraam from your residence. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"Zakat","u":"/question-answer-7/","h":"nq-question-7","x":"Q)Asslamualikum wm wb Dear Sir, I would like to ask regarding \"Zakat\".I just started working 1year back as a medical Dr. Am I obliged to contribute Zakat? If so,I would like to know how to calculate and upon what kind of properties to calculate. I have a car which I bought in loan scheme where I have to pay specific amount to the bank every month. Kindly let me know that is it necessary to contribute Zakat upon that car and how to calculate if eligible. Moreover,I would like to know that Zakat can be contributed any time or only during the month of Ramadan. Thank you and looking forward to you"},{"t":"Chand Sawalaat","u":"/question-answer-7/","h":"nq-question-8","x":"Q)Asalamualaikum wa rahmatullahi wabarakatuhu oumeed kai aap log theek ho. mere ko kuch sawalaat kai jabaat chai barai mehbani jaldi dai 1.JUMMA MAI KUL KITNI RAKAAT HAI AUR KIA JUMMA SAI PEH LAI KOI SUNNAT HAI TARTEEB SAI WAZIH KARE? 2. ZAWALE SHAMS KAI TIME TAHIYAATULMASJID PAR SAK TAI HAI YA NAHI YA SIREF MAKROUH HAI? 3 .AGER 2 LOG JAMAT KAI SAAT NAMAAZ ADA KAR RA HAI HO TU KIA MUQTADI KO IMAM KAI BARABER THER NA CHAI YA THORA SA PECHAI HET KAR ? PLZ DALEEL DO TU MEHBANI. KIUN KAI 1 SAHEB KAH RA HAI HAI KI IMAMA KAI BARABER THER NA CHAI ALLAH HAFIZ A)Asalamualaikum wa rahmatullahi wa baraka"},{"t":"Sajda shuker","u":"/question-answer-7/","h":"nq-question-9","x":"Q)Sajda shuker kai lia wazu zarori hai kia nahi aur qibla ru ho na bhi sharat hai kia? A)Sajda-e-Shukr ke liye Taharat zaroori hai yani ghusul kiye hue ho, aur ba wazu ho, isi tarah qibla ru hona bhi zaroori hai. (Reference: Hindiya-1/136; Kitabul Fatawa-2/451,459; Shami-1/577)"},{"t":"Zaqat","u":"/question-answer-8/","h":"nq-question-1","x":"Q)Ek sawal ye bhi hy ki KYA UDHAAR KE PAISE SE ZAQAT ADA KI JA SAKTI HY? for ex:- jaise kisi ka paisa kahin atka hua hy aur zaqat dene k liye us waqt cash nahi hy,to kya wo udhar k paise se zaqat ada kar sakta hy? aur udhar ada karne ki poori niyat bhi hy. A)Agar zakaat wajib hone ke baad qarz le kar ada karna hai to, phir qarz ke raqam se zakaat ada ki ja sakti hai. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"Zaqat","u":"/question-answer-8/","h":"nq-question-2","x":"Q)Salam alaikum mei puchna chah raha ki kya zaqat sirf ramzan k month mei hi deni chahiye? ya saal bhar mei kabhi bhi niyat kar k di ja sakti hy? for eg:- mere uper 30,000 rs zaqat banti hy to kya ramzan se pahle mei niyat kar k itni hi raqam 2 ya 3 zaroorat-mando ko de sakta hoon? 2:- kya zaqat ka paisa kisi aise insan ko diya ja sakta hy jo iska istemal apne bachche ko deeni taaleem dene mei lagayega? for ex:- wo bachcha aalim ki degree le raha hy to kya zaqat aise bachche ko di ja sakti hy?? wo ghareeb hy lekin aage padh nahi paa raha to usko wo zaqat ka pasia diya ja sakta hy? reply me as "},{"t":"Miscellaneous Ques.","u":"/question-answer-8/","h":"nq-question-3","x":"Q)Q1. Sadqe(jo zakaat l alawa) k maal se saiyed ko Umra karna jayez hai? aur agar kar liya hai to maal wapas karna hoga kya? Aur agar koi Umra karwata hai to wo batayega kyun ki wo zakaat ka paisa hai! Q2. Agar kisi mannat k puri honey par koi har mahine kuch nafil roza rakhta ho , lekin us par farz roza kaza baaki ho to kya wo kaza usse pura ho jayega. Ya uske liye alag se roza rakhna padega? Ya kaza farz roza har mahine rakhney se nafil apney aap ada ho jayegi? Q3.Main engineering college main admission ka kam shuru karna chahta hun. Jis ka admission entrance test ke jariye nahi hota hai usk"},{"t":"Ghair Musalmano ko Dawat-e-Imaan","u":"/question-answer-8/","h":"nq-question-4","x":"Q)Kya Maulana Ali Mian Nadwi Sb Ghair Musalmano me Dawat dene ke liye Kabhi Jamaat ke shakal me ya afrad bhejte thhe? Ya phir aapne talba ko ya Mureedain ko iss kaam ke liye bhejte thhe? Mustakil aur munazzam koi tehrek iss kaam ke silsie me unhone koi tarteeb qayam kiye thhe? Ya aapne Nasihat me isski khwas targheb dete thhe? Ya phir Markaz nizamuddin ki tarteeb ki hi taeed farmate rahe? Maulana Saad aur Maulana Zubair sab Hazrat Ali Mian (R) ne kis saal me Khilafat diye thhe? A)Maulana Ali Miyan (Rh) ko hamesha is ki fikr rahi ke dawat-e-Haq har ek tak pahunche. Nau-jawani me woh apne bade b"},{"t":"Shariat","u":"/question-answer-8/","h":"nq-question-5","x":"Q)What islam says regarding to keep the Fish Aquarium in Home & offices.? Plz guide in this matter. A)If the fishes are managed properly that they don't have problem of water, food and oxygen; in these circumstances, it is permissible. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"Shariat","u":"/question-answer-8/","h":"nq-question-6","x":"Q)What Shariat says using of Hot Solar water?is it permited by Hadith/ A)Offering wadhu and bathing in the solar water is Makrooh. (Darul Qutni: Babul ma`al maskhan: Hadith No. 2) Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"Employer/company’s Health Insurance.","u":"/question-answer-8/","h":"nq-question-7","x":"Q)Assalamu alaikum Har corporate Company may kam ku jamne se company sab ku Health Insurance dati hain. Wo sabhi employees ku yah laziman dete hain, har mah hamari tankha se premium k pise kat lete hain. Yah health insurance police sirf in-patient service cover kar ti hai. Agar hum hospital me rahker ilaj karain aur is k bill insurance company ku bhejain to insurance company bill ka takriban 80% pisa deti hai. Kiya is Health Insurance se fida utha sak te hai? Kiya hum apne hospital ke bill insurance company ku dekar pisa lesakte hai? Ya koi dusri surat hamare har mah kate hu’e paise ju insuran"},{"t":"Other","u":"/question-answer-8/","h":"nq-question-8","x":"Q)Assalamu alaikum Abru k bal (eye brow) k bare may auraton aur mardon ku kiya hokum hai? Abru k bal agar kuch bade hogain ho to kat sakte hain ya na hi? Dono abru k bich k bal yani nak k upper payshani per dono abru k bich k bal kat sakte hain ya na hi? Mardo ku kan per jo bal ugte hain kiya woh kat sakte hain? A)Abru ke bare me mard aur aurat barabar hain, magar mard agar in balon ko kat ta hai to us ke liye ziyada karahat ki baat hai, sirf faishon ki wajah se natural banawat ko badalna durust nahi hai. \"Allah ke Rasool (S.A.W.) ne baal noshne aur nuchwane waliyon par lanat farmayee hai\". (N"},{"t":"Ghar Waley k Huqooq, Video Chating","u":"/question-answer-8/","h":"nq-question-9","x":"Q)Assalam U Alaikum, Q1. Meri Salary qareeb 35000 rs hai. Hum 5 brothers aur ek sister hai. Khala bhi hain(khalu nahi hai), aur jo ristedaar gareeb hai wo saiyed hai. kiska kitna huqooq hai(sadka ,zakaat k alawa). Q2.Walidaa ko kitna dena hoga, aur Walid sahab ko kitna, kyunki aur bhi dini takaazey hai..Ma baap ka huqooq zaya na ho jaye. Allah Tala ka bhi bandey ke Maal me haq hai. Zara in Maamlaat ko wazey farmaye. Q2.Sadqe k maal se saiyed ko Umra karna jayez hai? aur agar kar liya hai to maal wapas karna hoga kya? Q3. Gmail par video chat karna jayez hai na jayez hai. fatwa aur taqwa kya ha"},{"t":"Interest Money","u":"/question-answer-8/","h":"nq-question-10","x":"Q)Kiya interest ka pisa apne garib musalman ristedaron ku desakte hain? A)Interest ka paisa apne Gharib Musalman Rishtedaron ko de sakte hain, lekin yah khyal rahe ki INTEREST ka Pasia ek GHALAZAT hai isliye aisy gandi cheez men musalmano ko Mulawwis karna bahtar nahy hai, iske Badal ke Taur par Allah Taala ne ZAKAT ka nizaam rakha hai, isliye bahtar yah hai ki unko ZAKAT ki raqam men se den, aur sab se achi baat to yah hai ki apne rishtedaron ki apni gadhi kamaye se MADAD ki jaaye. Wassalam Abul Hasan Ali Nadwi Center"},{"t":"Fatwa","u":"/question-answer-8/","h":"nq-question-11","x":"Q)What is qualification of a person to issue Fatwa? A)That person is entitled to issue fatwas whose beliefs and creed is correct, he is master in Shariah, bears modern knowledge as per the needs, keeps a close eye on the changes of the world and environment and un-biased on religious aspects."},{"t":"Shariat","u":"/question-answer-8/","h":"nq-question-12","x":"Q)What Shariah says regarding Beard? Is it complusion? A)Beard is one of the signs and symbols of Islam, and it is Wajib (compulsory) to grow beard. (Bukhari:5893)"}];
